{
  "html": "\u003csection style=\"box-sizing: border-box; width: 100%; padding: 0 0 24px; background-color: #f7f6f2; color: #26282a; font-family: Georgia, \u0026#39;Songti SC\u0026#39;, \u0026#39;STSong\u0026#39;, SimSun, serif; overflow-wrap: anywhere\" data-no-dark=\"\" id=\"cw-layout-imported\"\u003e\u003cimg src=\"data:image/png;base64,\" alt=\"\" data-cw-decor=\"1\" style=\"display: block; width: 100%; height: 56px\" data-no-dark=\"\"/\u003e\u003csection style=\"padding: 14px 18px 0\" data-no-dark=\"\"\u003e\u003csection style=\"margin: 0 0 18px; padding: 6px 0 12px 14px; border-left: 2px solid #45515c\" data-no-dark=\"\"\u003e\u003cp style=\"color: #394047; font-family: Georgia, \u0026#39;Songti SC\u0026#39;, \u0026#39;STSong\u0026#39;, SimSun, serif; font-size: 15px; letter-spacing: 0.8px; line-height: 1.95; margin: 0\"\u003e\u003cspan style=\"color: #1f272e; display: inline-block; font-size: 28px; font-weight: 700; line-height: 1; margin-right: 5px\"\u003e淡\u003c/span\u003e墨晕开远山三叠，雾色与留白交融在素宣之上，文字便有了行舟静水的从容。\u003c/p\u003e\u003c/section\u003e\u003csection style=\"margin: 26px 0 0\" data-no-dark=\"\"\u003e\u003csection style=\"margin: 0 0 14px; padding-bottom: 8px; border-bottom: 1px solid #d5d8da; display: table; width: 100%\" data-no-dark=\"\"\u003e\u003csection style=\"display: table-cell; width: 40px; vertical-align: middle\" data-no-dark=\"\"\u003e\u003cspan style=\"display: inline-block; width: 28px; height: 28px; line-height: 28px; text-align: center; background-color: #262d34; color: #f5f4f0; font-size: 15px; font-weight: 700\" data-no-dark=\"\"\u003e壹\u003c/span\u003e\u003c/section\u003e\u003ch2 style=\"display: table-cell; vertical-align: middle; margin: 0; font-size: 19px; font-weight: 600; letter-spacing: 2px; color: #1c2126\" data-no-dark=\"\"\u003e墨分五色，留白见意境\u003c/h2\u003e\u003c/section\u003e\u003csection data-no-dark=\"\"\u003e\u003csection data-no-dark=\"\"\u003e\u003cp style=\"color: #26282a; font-family: Georgia, \u0026#39;Songti SC\u0026#39;, \u0026#39;STSong\u0026#39;, SimSun, serif; font-size: 15px; letter-spacing: 0.8px; line-height: 1.96; margin: 0 0 15px\"\u003e卷首嵌以\u003cstrong style=\"color: #14181c; font-weight: 700\"\u003e淡墨山脊晕染横幅\u003c/strong\u003e，搭配砚墨黑方印大写序号与烟灰细竖线导语。\u003c/p\u003e\u003c/section\u003e\u003csection style=\"margin: 18px 0; padding: 14px 16px; background-color: #efefe9; border-left: 3px solid #6b7680\" data-no-dark=\"\"\u003e\u003cblockquote style=\"border: 0; margin: 0; padding: 0\"\u003e\u003cp style=\"color: #333b42; font-family: Georgia, \u0026#39;Songti SC\u0026#39;, \u0026#39;STSong\u0026#39;, SimSun, serif; font-size: 15px; font-style: italic; letter-spacing: 0.8px; line-height: 1.92; margin: 0\"\u003e山色空濛处，往往藏着中国美学最深远的留白。\u003c/p\u003e\u003c/blockquote\u003e\u003c/section\u003e\u003csection style=\"margin: 18px 0; padding: 6px; background-color: #ffffff; border: 1px solid #d5d7d8\" data-no-dark=\"\"\u003e\u003cimg src=\"https://api.gitcode.com/api/v5/repos/wendao-ai/wendao-ai-template-market/raw/sample-images/ink-mountains.jpg\" alt=\"晨雾笼罩的水墨远山与静水孤舟\" style=\"display: block; height: auto; margin: 0; max-width: 100%; width: 100%\"/\u003e\u003c/section\u003e\u003c/section\u003e\u003c/section\u003e\u003csection style=\"margin: 26px 0 0\" data-no-dark=\"\"\u003e\u003csection style=\"margin: 0 0 14px; padding-bottom: 8px; border-bottom: 1px solid #d5d8da; display: table; width: 100%\" data-no-dark=\"\"\u003e\u003csection style=\"display: table-cell; width: 40px; vertical-align: middle\" data-no-dark=\"\"\u003e\u003cspan style=\"display: inline-block; width: 28px; height: 28px; line-height: 28px; text-align: center; background-color: #262d34; color: #f5f4f0; font-size: 15px; font-weight: 700\" data-no-dark=\"\"\u003e贰\u003c/span\u003e\u003c/section\u003e\u003ch2 style=\"display: table-cell; vertical-align: middle; margin: 0; font-size: 19px; font-weight: 600; letter-spacing: 2px; color: #1c2126\" data-no-dark=\"\"\u003e水墨风长文的节奏留白\u003c/h2\u003e\u003c/section\u003e\u003csection data-no-dark=\"\"\u003e\u003csection style=\"margin: 14px 0\" data-no-dark=\"\"\u003e\u003cul style=\"color: #26282a; font-family: Georgia, \u0026#39;Songti SC\u0026#39;, \u0026#39;STSong\u0026#39;, SimSun, serif; font-size: 14.5px; line-height: 1.96; margin: 0; padding-left: 20px\"\u003e\u003cli style=\"margin: 0 0 7px\"\u003e56px 卷首山影横幅一秒定调东方诗意\u003c/li\u003e\u003cli style=\"margin: 0 0 7px\"\u003e首字下沉与砚墨方印形成黑白呼应\u003c/li\u003e\u003cli style=\"margin: 0 0 7px\"\u003e清雅烟灰引语框衬托古诗与金句\u003c/li\u003e\u003c/ul\u003e\u003c/section\u003e\u003csection style=\"margin: 16px 0\" data-no-dark=\"\"\u003e\u003ctable style=\"border-collapse: collapse; color: #26282a; font-size: 14px; line-height: 1.7; table-layout: fixed; width: 100%\"\u003e\u003cthead\u003e\u003ctr\u003e\u003cth style=\"background-color: #eaeced; border: 1px solid #d1d4d6; color: #1f272e; font-weight: 700; padding: 8px 10px; text-align: left\"\u003e维度\u003c/th\u003e\u003cth style=\"background-color: #eaeced; border: 1px solid #d1d4d6; color: #1f272e; font-weight: 700; padding: 8px 10px; text-align: left\"\u003e版式表现\u003c/th\u003e\u003c/tr\u003e\u003c/thead\u003e\u003ctbody\u003e\u003ctr\u003e\u003ctd style=\"background-color: #fcfcfa; border: 1px solid #d1d4d6; color: #26282a; padding: 8px 10px\"\u003e卷首装饰\u003c/td\u003e\u003ctd style=\"background-color: #fcfcfa; border: 1px solid #d1d4d6; color: #26282a; padding: 8px 10px\"\u003e水墨山脊晕染横幅 PNG\u003c/td\u003e\u003c/tr\u003e\u003ctr\u003e\u003ctd style=\"background-color: #fcfcfa; border: 1px solid #d1d4d6; color: #26282a; padding: 8px 10px\"\u003e编号风格\u003c/td\u003e\u003ctd style=\"background-color: #fcfcfa; border: 1px solid #d1d4d6; color: #26282a; padding: 8px 10px\"\u003e砚墨黑印 壹 / 贰\u003c/td\u003e\u003c/tr\u003e\u003c/tbody\u003e\u003c/table\u003e\u003c/section\u003e\u003csection style=\"margin: 26px 0 0; padding-top: 12px; border-top: 1px solid #cfd3d6; text-align: center\" data-no-dark=\"\"\u003e\u003cp style=\"color: #5a6269; font-family: Georgia, \u0026#39;Songti SC\u0026#39;, \u0026#39;STSong\u0026#39;, SimSun, serif; font-size: 13.5px; letter-spacing: 0.8px; line-height: 1.88; margin: 0; text-align: center\"\u003e读罢此卷，如临清江薄雾，满目皆是安宁。\u003c/p\u003e\u003cspan data-cw-decor=\"1\" style=\"display: inline-block; margin-top: 8px; padding: 1px 10px; border: 1px solid #3c464f; font-size: 11px; letter-spacing: 3px; color: #3c464f\" data-no-dark=\"\"\u003e山色空濛\u003c/span\u003e\u003c/section\u003e\u003c/section\u003e\u003c/section\u003e\u003c/section\u003e\u003c/section\u003e",
